489080c75826d8aa4ef6e7b1936a`\n- Completion status: `FULL AUDIT COMPLETE`\n\n## Deliverables\n\n- `docs/reports/CIECOPILOT_FULL_REPO_HEALTH_AUDIT.md`\n- `docs/reports/CIECOPILOT_FULL_REPO_FINDINGS.json`\n- `docs/reports/CIECOPILOT_REFACTOR_PROGRAM.md`\n- `docs/reports/CIECOPILOT_COVERAGE_LEDGER.csv`\n- `docs/reports/INDEX.md` registration\n\n## Evidence summary\n\n- 34,366 tracked files inventoried\n- 76-row Coverage Ledger covering every top-level directory and important secondary surface\n- 1,534-commit reconstructed main history reviewed by development epoch\n- 30 evidence-backed findings: 7 P1, 22 P2, 1 P3, 0 P0\n- Source, generated data, immutable artifacts, historical evidence, docs, tests, and binaries classified separately\n- Early-era code, A+ W10-W15 reconciliation, current Semantic KG engineering, and pending-PR boundaries reviewed independently\n\n## Verification\n\n- `jq empty CIECOPILOT_FULL_REPO_FINDINGS.json`\n- finding IDs are unique and all 30 records include the required evidence fields\n- Coverage Ledger parses as 76 data rows × 15 columns\n- required report and refactor-program sections are present\n- remote commit diff contains only the four deliverables plus report-index registration\n\n## Boundaries\n\nThis PR publishes audit evidence only. It does not modify runtime code, semantic KG authority, generated release artifacts, dependencies, workflows, Supabase, remote data, production, or staging. The refactor program is advisory and requires characterization before implementation.","created_at":"2026-07-29T09:05:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T09:16:19Z","closed_at":"2026-07-29T09:06:53Z","merged_at":"2026-07-29T09:06:53Z","merge_commit_sha":"16749b33396dee6f7b2e8c1413fc576db17db18a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1763/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-